---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Hello Baseball!</h1>
			<p>
				Welcome to the official Baseball Attendance Simulator (BAS) website. We appreciate your interest in
				reshaping the sport and in the tools we offer to our customers.
			</p>
			<p>
				BAS is a San Diego-based startup focused on <strong>merging public MLB datasets and using advanced coding techniques</strong> to
				extract and estimate valuable data that could make a meaningful difference for baseball enthusiasts alike. Our users are primarily ticket
				vendors and for customers seeing possible predictions of pricing and attendance metrics for MLB games. 
			</p>
			<p>Some of the goals we strive to achieve with this project are:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Go a step further and present manageable, measurable ticket pricing data that leads to improved revenue.</li>
				<li>Harness the power of machine learning and artificial intelligence to replace outdated systems.</li>
				<li>Create a user-friendly application that can be deployed in a variety of scenarios anywhere.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Want a guide? <strong>Check out our <a href="/blog/markdown-style-guide">user manual</a>.</strong>
			</p>
			<p>
				Welcome again to BAS, and we hope to hear from you soon. We're unfortunately not affiliated with MLB in any shape or form.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
